        "observation": "NOC and REG both notified that OpCo's support chatbot displayed another subscriber's billing address and recent call records.",
        "rule": "The incident matches the UAE-PDPL Data Breach definition in UAE-PDPL#0003.",
        "inference": "I should open an investigation into OpCo to examine the complaint and the breach."
      },
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "UAE-PDPL#0003",
