        "observation": "NOC states the vendor hosts the model and chat logs outside the UAE.",
        "rule": "UAE-PDPL Article 22 provides that personal data may be transferred outside the State only in cases approved by the Bureau.",
        "inference": "I should assess the legal basis of OpCo's cross-border transfer to the vendor."
      },
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "UAE-PDPL#0072",
          "quote": "Personal Data may be transferred to outside of the State in the following cases approved by the Bureau:"
        }
